Subject: MainCommand: Replace Bukkit.getScheduler().runTaskAsynchronously with AsyncScheduler

AE PATCH REASON: Bukkit.getScheduler().runTaskAsynchronously is rejected by Folia (UnsupportedOperationException on region-threaded architecture).
